    <bpmn:process id="W_W3628" name="W3628. Paint Mixing &amp; Tinting Dispenser Calibration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Paint-dispenser calibration cycle (W3619); new dispenser; color-matching issue
Frequency: Usage/time-based (high-usage in paint season)
Volume: Paint mixing/tinting dispensers across 200 stores (custom tinting per VS-09.1)
Owner: Metrology Manager / In-Store Services
Participants: Metrology Manager, In-Store Services (links to VS-09.1), Store Operations (links to VS-07), Facilities (links to VS-07.2), Quality (links to VS-31), Vendor (dispenser manufacturer)
Source: workflow W3628 — Paint Mixing &amp; Tinting Dispenser Calibration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3628_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3628_Lane1" name="Metrology Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3628_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3628_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3628_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3628_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3628_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3628_Start3" name="Paint-dispenser calibration cycle (W3619); new dispenser; color-matching issue">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3628_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3628_Task4" name="Metrology Manager/Calibration Technicians calibrate paint tinting/colorant…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Metrology Manager/Calibration Technicians calibrate paint tinting/colorant dispensers: dispense-volume accuracy per colorant channel (the metered dose determines color accuracy), peristaltic/piston pump calibration, volume verification by weight (traceable W3618), and the color-match formula integrity; adjust, as-left verify, OOT determination (W3634)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Calibration Technicians / Vendor
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Per dispenser</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3628_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3628_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3628_Task5" name="Metrology Manager/Services manage color-accuracy: ensure the dispensed color…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Metrology Manager/Services manage color-accuracy: ensure the dispensed color matches the formula/target (color-matching spectrophotometer calibration where used), manage colorant shelf-life/settling that affects dose, and the customer color-match acceptance; coordinate vendor service for complex dispensers
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Services / Vendor
Accountable (A): Quality Manager / COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3628_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3628_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3628_Task6" name="Metrology Manager capture records (W3624), respond to OOT and customer color…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Metrology Manager capture records (W3624), respond to OOT and customer color complaints (links to W3639/VS-13), and report paint-dispenser accuracy to governance (W3640); manage the calibration interface with facility/equipment maintenance (links to VS-07.2) and private-label paint (links to VS-41)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Services / Facilities
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3628_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3628_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
