    <bpmn:process id="W_W3629" name="W3629. DC Weighbridge &amp; Truck Scale Calibration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Weighbridge calibration cycle (W3619); new weighbridge; OOT/receipt discrepancy
Frequency: Statutory + usage-based (high-volume DC)
Volume: DC weighbridges / truck scales at 4 DCs (inbound/outbound cargo weighing)
Owner: Metrology Manager / DC Operations
Participants: Metrology Manager, DC Operations (links to VS-04), Facilities (links to VS-20.3), Calibration Technicians (W3622), External Lab for heavy weights (W3621), Quality (links to VS-31), Compliance (links to VS-22), Logistics (links to VS-06/VS-110)
Source: workflow W3629 — DC Weighbridge &amp; Truck Scale Calibration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3629_LaneSet2">
