      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3629_Start3" name="Weighbridge calibration cycle (W3619); new weighbridge; OOT/receipt discrepancy">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3629_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3629_Task4" name="Metrology Manager/External Lab calibrate DC weighbridges/truck scales…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Metrology Manager/External Lab calibrate DC weighbridges/truck scales: multi-point verification using certified heavy test weights / weight-carts/ substitute methods (traceable W3618), eccentricity/span/linearity across the weighbridge, adjustment, as-left verify, OOT determination (W3634); on-site calibration given the size
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / External Lab / Calibration Technicians
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Per weighbridge</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3629_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3629_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3629_Task5" name="Metrology Manager/Compliance secure DTI verification/seal for legal-for-trade…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Metrology Manager/Compliance secure DTI verification/seal for legal-for-trade weighbridges used in commerce (W3633); manage the statutory cycle and the seal integrity; ensure non-trade weighbridges clearly labelled if used for process control only
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Compliance
Accountable (A): Quality Manager / VP Legal
Duration: Per statutory cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3629_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3629_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3629_Task6" name="Metrology Manager/DC Ops manage the weighbridge calibration cycle and records…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Metrology Manager/DC Ops manage the weighbridge calibration cycle and records (W3624), respond to OOT and receipt-weight discrepancies (links to VS-04/W3634), and report weighbridge accuracy to governance (W3640); coordinate with inbound receiving accuracy (links to VS-04.1) and freight (links to VS-110)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / DC Ops / Facilities
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3629_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3629_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3629_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3629_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
