Frequency: Statutory + usage-based
Volume: Fuel dispensers, tank gauges, telematics across fleet and DC fuel infrastructure
Owner: Metrology Manager / Fleet &amp; Facilities
Participants: Metrology Manager, Fleet/Fuel (links to VS-61/VS-06), Facilities (links to VS-20.3), Calibration Technicians (W3622), Quality (links to VS-31), Compliance (links to VS-22), DTI/Weights &amp; Measures
Source: workflow W3630 — Fuel &amp; Logistics Measurement Calibration</bpmn:documentation>
