      <bpmn:userTask id="W3630_Task4" name="Metrology Manager/Calibration Technicians calibrate fuel &amp; logistics…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Metrology Manager/Calibration Technicians calibrate fuel &amp; logistics measurement: fuel dispensers/pumps (volume accuracy), tank gauges/ATG (level/volume), and telematics/fuel sensors on vehicles; verify against traceable volume/mass standards (W3618), adjust, as-left verify, OOT determination (W3634)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Calibration Technicians / Vendor
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Per device</bpmn:documentation>
