        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Metrology Manager/Compliance secure DTI verification/seal for legal-for-trade fuel dispensers if applicable (W3633); manage statutory cycle; ensure tank-gauge accuracy for inventory and environmental compliance (links to VS-24)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Compliance
Accountable (A): Quality Manager / VP Legal
Duration: Per statutory cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3630_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3630_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3630_Task6" name="Metrology Manager/Fleet manage the fuel-measurement calibration cycle and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Metrology Manager/Fleet manage the fuel-measurement calibration cycle and records (W3624), respond to OOT and fuel-variance/fuel-theft investigation (links to VS-61/VS-23), and report fuel-measurement accuracy to governance (W3640); coordinate with fleet cost management (links to VS-61)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Fleet / Facilities
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3630_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3630_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
