    <bpmn:process id="W_W3632" name="W3632. Test &amp; Measurement Tool Calibration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Test-tool calibration cycle (W3619); new tool; quality/acceptance decision
Frequency: Usage/time-based
Volume: Test &amp; measurement tools (quality, tool rental, field services)
Owner: Metrology Manager / Quality
Participants: Metrology Manager, Quality (links to VS-31), Tool Rental (links to VS-12.2), Installation/Services (links to VS-12), Solar/Field Services (links to VS-70/VS-66), Calibration Technicians (W3622), External Labs (W3621)
Source: workflow W3632 — Test &amp; Measurement Tool Calibration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3632_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3632_Lane1" name="Metrology Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3632_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3632_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3632_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3632_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3632_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3632_Start3" name="Test-tool calibration cycle (W3619); new tool; quality/acceptance decision">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3632_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3632_Task4" name="Metrology Manager/Quality calibrate test &amp; measurement tools…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Metrology Manager/Quality calibrate test &amp; measurement tools: calipers/micrometers, multimeters/electrical testers, torque tools, levels/lasers, pressure/vacuum gauges, and inspection equipment used in quality (VS-31), tool rental (VS-12.2), installation/field services (VS-12/VS-70/VS-66); verify against traceable standards (W3618), adjust, as-left verify, OOT determination (W3634)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Calibration Technicians / Quality
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Per tool</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3632_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3632_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3632_Task5" name="Metrology Manager/Quality manage the impact of tool calibration on quality and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Metrology Manager/Quality manage the impact of tool calibration on quality and acceptance decisions: ensure measurement results used for product acceptance (links to VS-31), rental-tool readiness (links to VS-12.2), and field-service quality (links to VS-12/VS-70) are traceable and defensible; manage the in-house vs. external routing (W3621/W3622)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Quality / Services
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3632_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3632_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3632_Task6" name="Metrology Manager capture records (W3624), respond to OOT (W3634) and the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Metrology Manager capture records (W3624), respond to OOT (W3634) and the impact on past acceptances (recall/inspect if a tool was OOT during prior use), and report test-tool accuracy to governance (W3640); manage rental-tool calibration as part of rental readiness (links to VS-12.2)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Quality / Tool Rental
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3632_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3632_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3632_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3632_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3632_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-575 (ensure controlled execution — Device Calibration Operations (PA-115.2).) | - operational: calibration and OOT-impact assessment; operational: rental-readiness calibration
Owner: Metrology Manager / Quality</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3632_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3632_Annotation8" targetRef="W3632_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3632_Flow10" sourceRef="W3632_Start3" targetRef="W3632_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3632_Flow11" sourceRef="W3632_Task4" targetRef="W3632_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3632_Flow12" sourceRef="W3632_Task5" targetRef="W3632_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3632_Flow13" sourceRef="W3632_Task6" targetRef="W3632_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
